<description>&lt;p&gt;A small plane crashed shortly after takeoff in Mexico, killing the pilot and co-pilot. An escaped California inmate is being pursued after killing a Mexican police commander in a shootout. A Mexican priest has recovered from a kidnapping ordeal. The crisis continues with violent incidents across the border region, including vehicle pursuits and shootings near the U.S.-Mexico border. 37 battle-related deaths were recorded in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KYMA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNSmNOS3J5NHhweVp5Z1ZrVmFEdml4ZnNsd3JWM2RTN19iWUstd3l2eUZxSkt0NndtTXI5V2VkTEZOYTM3ZlpZbVJ4SnFRMWdoTFFxYWh1ekF4Nko2ZkdtUklIV3UzTDNHcFViODhxU2RJSGNNWmxnMlo0c1dFTnhSeQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;FOX 11 Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NBC Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQTjhvQUNDemFWcm1qaXo5eU5rbGpRX3Viak5abnp1X3lsWEVmM3I3WFVXdXExOVE5NDN4VjdCcGdqMjRDSEd0WV9rYnZjS1VZMWlxU0p2Y0lhX2RHUk5wOUFPOFhFZUhjSDItQ0VKTkdBZ2M2WjVQRDdIRlo3R1FaVEE0S1gwcmZ5ZjZGLWJYUkJsT1dEdnd0ZzY1aFhLR29ZWkxmazJJc2l2T0tX?oc=5&quot;&gt;People.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPY0RfS3JmdEtteW15RW5ndlVhQnM5SDIyWVV3NWhiYTRrNjJVWmtia2lkZ0taNlVhcW1GNjNRcDdjLTc1Q3UxS2NPRjl5WDBabkpoTEdwaFZkYklxaDJ3b1hxQmdaVnBvMFJfdEtrX25xejlxTjBlblkyU3IxcVFWb0htT0c0bVJHbnl2eHVkS29VelFaUV9LYUJ5MEV3NTZGVnh3c0ZJSmJTNFdoakwzQWQ2TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Telangana Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQdFFxOWNZcWstWVVmNEdqSjYxTlZvZ1daeXB0NTBDZHl6UVQyd2RLZEV5WWlZWFVDcXF4R1dDQ093UFlreFlENHVVUkZoSnFRc0VNLUNUcnQ2YXMxMWVvcFZYU3VFSjIzMjQ3ZUhPZ1Iya